me":"ADRES","isEditable":true,"label":"ADRES","visible":true},{"fieldName":"OBJECTID","isEditable":true,"label":"OBJECTID","visible":false},{"fieldName":"GlobalID","isEditable":true,"label":"GlobalID","visible":false},{"fieldName":"Shape__Area","isEditable":true,"label":"Shape__Area","visible":false},{"fieldName":"Shape__Length","isEditable":true,"label":"Shape__Length","visible":false}],"title":""},"popupEnabled":false},{"_uid":"09980d59f9b","url":"https://geocoder.arcgisonline.nl/arcgis/rest/services/Geocoder_NL_RD/GeocodeServer","singleLineFieldName":"SingleLine","name":"Adressen","placeholder":"A","maxResults":6,"maxSuggestions":6,"suggestionsEnabled":true,"minSuggestCharacters":1,"withinViewEnabled":false,"countryCode":"","zoomScale":null}],"activeSourceIndex":-1},"title":"Werfkelders","customHeader":false,"splash":true,"sidebarExpanded":true,"activePanel":"details","layerListPanel":true,"bookmarksPanel":false,"layerEditPanel":false,"detailsContent":"<p><span style=\"color:hsl(0,75%,60%);\"><strong>Let op: Het Wervenkadaster is verhuisd.</strong></span></p><p>Het Wervenkadaster is verhuist naar een nieuwe omgeving. Ga naar <a href=\"https://kaart.utrecht.nl/?@Wervenkadaster\">https://kaart.utrecht.nl/?@Wervenkadaster</a> of klik op <a href=\"https://kaart.utrecht.nl/?@Wervenkadaster\" target=\"_blank\">deze link</a> om het nieuwe Wervenkadaster te openen.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>Deze kaart is opgesteld om alle bekende kelders onder de openbare weg in Utrecht inzichtelijk te maken. Helpt u mee onbekende kelders (mintgroene kleur) in kaart te brengen? Meld deze dan via </i><a href=\"mailto:werven@utrecht.nl\" target=\"_blank\"><i>werven@utrecht.nl</i></a><i>.</i></p><p><br><i>Aan deze kaart kunnen geen rechten worden ontleend.</i></p><p><br><i>De gemeente Utrecht doet haar best om de informatie op deze kaart kloppend en actueel te houden. Komt u iets tegen wat niet klopt of sterk verouderd is, dan vinden wij het fijn als u ons dat laat weten. Dat kan via ons </i><a href=\"https://www.utrecht.nl/reactieformulier\" target=\"_blank\"><i>reactieformulier</i></a><i> of bel 14 030.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>Klik op <strong>Legenda </strong>voor meer informatie over wat u op de kaart ziet.</i></p><p><i>Klik op <strong>Details </strong>voor informatie over het wervenkadaster.</i></p><p><i>Klik op <strong>Kaartlagen </strong>voor meer data over de kelders, plus extra kaartmateriaal over de binnenstad.</i></p><p><i>Klik op <strong>Info </strong>voor informatie over de geselecteerde kelder.</i></p><p><i>Klik op <strong>Filter </strong>om ook de kelders buiten de scope van het Wervenprogramma zichtbaar te maken. Dit moet per Kelder-laag apart ingesteld worden.</i></p>","filterPanel":true,"basemapGallery":false,"enableFeatureSearchScale":false,"popupHover":false,"compassWidget":false,"locateWidget":false,"measure":false,"keyboardShortcuts":true,"disableScroll":false,"scalebarDualMode":false,"extentSelector":true,"enableHighlightColor":true,"enableHighlightHaloColor":true,"basemapToggle":false,"share":false,"customUrlParam":{"layers":[{"id":"1958fb96a41-layer-27","fields":["KLDR_ID"],"fieldOrder":[]}]},"panelSize":"m","theme":"light","customTheme":{"applySharedTheme":false,"applyPresetTheme":true,"font":"Arial","appFont":"Arial","logo":"https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/b1c07d133dde407ea96d08f460236f08/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1712215963941_Utrecht_Logo.png","logoLink":"https://www.utrecht.nl/","logoScale":"m","preset":null,"themes":{"primary":{"type":"primary","background":"#FFFFFF","text":"#000000"},"secondary":{"type":"secondary","background":"#FFFFFF","text":"#000000"},"accent":{"type":"accent","background":"#2964A3","text":"#ffffff"}}},"uploads":["https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/b1c07d133dde407ea96d08f460236f08/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1712215963941_Utrecht_Logo.png"],"compassWidgetPosition":{"position":"top-left","index":4},"locateWidgetPositio